    {
      "name": "Draconic Frenzy",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The dragon makes two claw Strikes and one horn Strike in any order.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Draconic Momentum",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The dragon recharges their Thundercloud Breath whenever they score a critical hit with a Strike.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Dragonmist",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "manipulate",
        "water"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The dragon conjures up a sudden mist in a 20ft Type:burst within 120 feet. All creatures within the mist become Concealed, and all creatures outside the mist become concealed to creatures within it. The dragon can use this action again to dismiss the mist—anyone else attempting to remove the dragonmist (via gust of wind or similar) must succeed at a counteract check. A young dragon can have up to three clouds of dragonmist active at a time.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Thundercloud Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "electricity",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes a thundercloud that deals 11d6 Electricity Damage damage in a 40ft Type:cone (Basic DC 29 Reflex Saving Throw save). They can't use Thundercloud Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
